[Music]  tensions between Prince Harry megan  morkul and the royal family seemed to be  cooling down et has learned I want you  to hear the truth for me when the couple  made their final appearance with Prince  William and Kate Middleton at the  Commonwealth Day service on March 9th  things were icy  there was a brief hello a nod of  acknowledgement between the four of them  but no moment for them to come together  for a hug or even a conversation so it  did feel that there was quite a lot of  distance between the four of them now  two weeks later a source tells ET that  the Sussex is and the royal family  are in a better space adding that Harry  and Megan are still on track to step  down as senior Royals on March 31st as  planned quote while of course there have  been tensions the family is getting  through it the decision that's I have  made for my wife and I to step back is  not one I made lightly the Sussex duo  announced their decision to step back as  senior Royals in a bombshell statement  in January adding that they were working  to become financially independent and  plan to split their time between the UK  and Canada I hope that helps you  understand what did it come to that I  would step my family back from all I  have ever known  just stickers to take a step forward  into what I hope can be a more peaceful  life our source reiterates that this was  a difficult decision for Harry and Megan  they loved their family but given the  relentless media scrutiny the couple did  what they thought was right  for their immediate family and their son  Archie that said the source tells ET  that William wasn't happy that things  weren't handled privately  Megan and Harry made a final string of  royal appearances earlier this month  before returning to Vancouver Island to  be with baby Archie we all take your  leap of faith  so thank you for giving me the courage  to take this next step  [Music]

